# One helper, two callers, two files: what a step reaches is the closure of its calls in the graph of occurrences, so
# `write_to` under `alpha` writes alpha's file and under `beta` beta's (rule 5).

route twocallers.run
step run/alpha
step run/alpha/write_to
step run/beta
step run/beta/write_to

line entry > run call
line run/alpha/write_to > File(data/alpha.txt) own
line run/beta/write_to > File(data/beta.txt) own

side entry left
side File(data/alpha.txt) right
side File(data/beta.txt) right
